@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List predefined forms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forms
Accept: application/json

### Get Form 1 (fields needed to fill in the user fields)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/1
Accept: application/json

### Complete Form 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/1/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "B": 1, "C": 2, "E": 3, "F": 4 }
}

### Complete Form 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/2/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "B": 1.5, "D": -2.25, "E": 10 }
}

### Form 3 has a circular dependency -> 200 with status "invalid", error and cycle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/3
Accept: application/json

### Form 3 cannot be calculated -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/3/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "B": 1, "D": 2 }
}

### Invalid input: calculated field set, unknown field, missing user fields -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/1/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "A": 5, "B": 1, "Z": 2 }
}

### Malformed value -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/1/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "B": "one", "C": 2, "E": 3, "F": 4 }
}

### Unknown form -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forms/99/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": { "B": 1 }
}
